!
! This versioned filename is selected only by a compiler that implements
! the matching RV64/lp64d unmasked fixed and scalable vector ABIs.  The
! generator validates that mathvec-variants.mk contains the exact m2 N pair
! for each of log, exp, sin, cos and pow before emitting any directive.
! A mathvec-disabled build installs this file with comments only, so it
! remains a valid no-SIMD contract and cannot fall back to the log-only v1
! contract in the same sysroot.
@MATHVEC_FORTRAN_BUILTINS@
